## Changes recorded

- Captured invoked Java fast and reflective decoding for nullable V2 compact
  fields, inherited `RpcRequestHeader` fields, malformed numbers, and
  V1-to-V2 conversion.
- Rust V2 fields `a`–`n` now retain nullable states. Fast mode ignores the
  inherited fields while reflection mode reads `ns`, `nsd`, `bname`, `oway`,
  and `lo`; fast malformed-number errors and reflective per-field null results
  match Java.
- V1-to-V2 conversion maps `brokerName` to compact field `n` and does not copy
  inherited RPC fields. Removed the Rust-only public `normalized_v1` helper.
- Updated the request-code inventory and Phase 6 P18-V01 audit disposition.

